00:07:02.220 --> 00:07:14.700
There are only a handful of companies that are certified to perform revaluations in Connecticut and vision is one of the premier companies having performed hundreds of revaluations throughout New England and as far south as Virginia

00:07:15.115 --> 00:07:16.795
